  "id": "sardine-and-fennel-bucatini",
  "name": "Sardine and Fennel Bucatini",
  "subtitle": "Sicilian-style pasta with saffron, raisins, and crisp crumbs",
  "description": "Bucatini is tossed with sardines, fennel, saffron wine, raisins, pine nuts, and chile, then finished with toasted crumbs and fennel fronds.",
